# Copy to .env (same directory). Expo loads it automatically on `npx expo start`.
# The live Parkable API endpoint (CloudFormation stack `parkable-api` output ApiEndpoint):
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://8o6uod8i7f.execute-api.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/Prod

# OPTIONAL. The VAPID public key for Web Push is committed as a default in
# utils/webPush.ts, so nothing needs setting here or in Vercel for push to
# work - it is a public value, not a credential (the matching PRIVATE key
# stays in SSM and never leaves the server).
# Set this only to point a build at a DIFFERENT key than the committed one,
# e.g. a separate staging application server. It overrides the default.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
